# HOST gate on the VMM's structured-config delivery (no boot): real
# persistent-FIDL decode of the produced .cm and .cvf, asserting the schema, the
# delivered values, that the two artifacts' checksums agree (without which
# component_manager refuses to deliver them together), and that `low_mmio_mb` is
# still absent. See the test's header for why that last one is an assertion
# rather than an omission.
rust_test(
    name = "vmm_config_decode_test",
    srcs = ["tests/vmm_config_decode.rs"],
    data = [
        ":cryogen_vmm_cvf",
        ":cryogen_vmm_manifest",
